# Preferred Plumbing SEO

Family-owned plumber **headquartered in Spirit Lake, Idaho** (Ron & Hunter Norris). Serve North Idaho and Eastern Washington. Do not invent stats, reviews, 24/7 hours, or job counts.

## Technical (never regress)

- Unique `<title>` and meta description per URL; one `<h1>`; logical heading order.
- Canonical `https://www.callpreferredplumbing.com/...`; valid LocalBusiness/Plumber, Service, FAQPage, BreadcrumbList.
- NAP must match the Spirit Lake GBP on every page (never a fake city address). No fabricated AggregateRating.
- Descriptive image alt; webp/avif; no blank or filename-style alt.
- Sitemap via next-sitemap; do not block indexable URLs in robots.txt.
- Mobile-first: header/click-to-call visible without scrolling on home, service, and area pages.

## Content strategy (priority order)

1. `/areas/spirit-lake-id` is the deepest page: named neighborhoods, wells/septic, service+location sections, local FAQ. Own “plumber Spirit Lake.”
2. Radiant heat / heated driveways are the low-competition wedge. Cluster posts must link to those service pages and a relevant area page; service pages link back.
3. Area pages need unique local copy (drive time from Spirit Lake, landmarks, town-specific FAQs and 2–3 featured services). No city-name-swap templates. No thin new town pages.
4. Blog posts ≥600 words, original, locally specific, with a service link and an area link. Steady cadence, not bursts.

## Do not

- Keyword-stuff or copy competitor phrasing (Lilac City templates).
- Create near-duplicate URLs (e.g. extra “emergency plumber Spirit Lake” pages). Parent service hubs already own Spirit Lake.
- Split `/services/water-heaters` or `/services/sewer-line`; company is not 24/7 (Sun–Fri 7am–5pm).
- Remove area/service coverage to “simplify.”
- Add third-party scripts without a Core Web Vitals check.
- Claim gallery jobs as a specific city unless the photo is verified for that town.

## Recurring (flag to the owner)

Quarterly competitor and Search Console town/query gaps before building new pages. After a Google update, check GSC before blaming a code change.

**Copy, not new URLs:** On Post Falls / Rathdrum / Hayden (Lilac City cross-shop), surface free estimates and no dispatch fee near CTAs — never name the competitor. On Spirit Lake / Rathdrum / Athol / Blanchard, lean on shop radius and same-day reality, not well/septic prose a Spokane shop can copy. Do not invent town-tagged job photos or timestamps.

